timeline.body:
Minor nit to eliminate the number of `return`s is to assign the new value to r and return it instead:

```suggestion
        if (r instanceof GeoShape) {
            r = r.toString();
        } else if (r instanceof Interval) {
            if (mode == CLI) {
                r = r.toString();
            } else {
                r = ((Interval) r).value();
            }
        }

        return r;
```

